█▀▄ █▀█ ░█░ ░█░ █▀█ █░▀█ █▄█ █░▀░█ █▀█ █▀▄  ██▄ █░█ ██▄</pre></h1><div class="gap"></div><p class="bold">Rayyan Omar</p><p>Software Engineer | AI/Cloud/Cybersecurity Enthusiast | Open Source Contributor</p><div class="gap"></div><div class="intro"><p>I am a Software Engineering (CO-OP) student at the University of Ottawa. My technical foundation includes Python, Java, TypeScript, SQL, FastAPI, Spring Boot, React, Docker, CI/CD, and MongoDB.</p><p>I specialize in building scalable, event-driven architectures and multi-agent AI systems, highlighted by developing AeroGuard, an AI-powered Security Operations Center that won First Place for Best Use of Snowflake at HackConcordia, and Chronos Cloud, a real-time smart city command center orchestrating 14 APIs and 7 specialized AI agents.</p><p>Beyond hackathons, I configure self-hosted Linux server infrastructure, deploying offline LLMs and managing secure remote networking pipelines.</p><p>In leadership and professional roles, I serve as Chair of the Board of Directors at Capital Technologies, directed operations for over 900 participants as Co-VP of Logistics for the Hack the Hill Hackathon, and authored standardized technical safety protocols during a materials engineering co-op at the National Research Council.</p></div><div class="gap"></div><h2 class="accent bold">Available Commands:</h2><dl class="cmd-list"><div class="cmd-row"><dt>help</dt><dd class="muted">Show available commands</dd></div><div class="cmd-row"><dt>ls [dir]</dt><dd class="muted">List the contents of a directory</dd></div><div class="cmd-row"><dt>cd &lt;dir&gt;</dt><dd class="muted">Open a directory (e.g. cd courses/ITI1121)</dd></div><div class="cmd-row"><dt>cd ..</dt><dd class="muted">Go up one directory</dd></div><div class="cmd-row"><dt>cd / or cd ~</dt><dd class="muted">Return to home</dd></div><div class="cmd-row"><dt>cd -</dt><dd class="muted">Return to the previous directory</dd></div><div class="cmd-row"><dt>pwd</dt><dd class="muted">Print the current directory</dd></div><div class="cmd-row"><dt>back</dt><dd class="muted">Go to the previous page</dd></div><div class="cmd-row"><dt>resume</dt><dd class="muted">Download resume (PDF)</dd></div><div class="cmd-row"><dt>clear</dt><dd class="muted">Clear terminal output (Ctrl+L)</dd></div></dl><div class="gap"></div><section class="listing" aria-label="Directory contents"><h2 class="accent bold">Directories:</h2><ul class="dir-list"><li class="dir-row"><a class="dir-name" href="/experience" data-discover="true">experience/</a><span class="muted">Work, research and leadership experience</span></li><li class="dir-row"><a class="dir-name" href="/projects" data-discover="true">projects/</a><span class="muted">Software, engineering, personal and university projects</span></li><li class="dir-row"><a class="dir-name" href="/courses" data-discover="true">courses/</a><span class="muted">University courses with assignments and labs</span></li><li class="dir-row"><a class="dir-name" href="/contact" data-discover="true">contact/</a><span class="muted">Contact information</span></li></ul></section></div></section><div class="line input-line"><span class="prompt"><span class="prompt-user">rayyan@portfolio</span>:<span class="prompt-path">~</span>$ </span><span class="input-mirror" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cursor"> </span></span><input class="input-native" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" enterkeyhint="go" aria-label="Terminal command input" type="text" value=""></div></main>"
`;

