on class="section"><h2 class="section-heading">Links</h2><dl class="fields"><div class="field-row"><dt class="muted">repository</dt><dd><a href="https://github.com/Rayyan0080/precision_auto_repair" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://github.com/Rayyan0080/precision_auto_repair</a></dd></div><div class="field-row"><dt class="muted">live demo</dt><dd><a href="https://rayyan0080.github.io/precision_auto_repair/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://rayyan0080.github.io/precision_auto_repair/</a></dd></div><div class="field-row"><dt class="muted">created</dt><dd>2026-06-07</dd></div><div class="field-row"><dt class="muted">updated</dt><dd>2026-06-08</dd></div><div class="field-row"><dt class="muted">languages</dt><dd>JavaScript, CSS, HTML</dd></div></dl></section><section class="section"><h2 class="section-heading">Related</h2><ul class="bullets"><li><a href="/courses/SEG3125/assignments/assignment-2" data-discover="true">Course assignment</a></li></ul></section></article><div class="line input-line"><span class="prompt"><span class="prompt-user">rayyan@portfolio</span>:<span class="prompt-path">~/projects/university-projects/precision-auto-repair</span>$ </span><span class="input-mirror" aria-hidden="true"><span class="cursor"> </span></span><input class="input-native" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" autocorrect="off" autocapitalize="off" enterkeyhint="go" aria-label="Terminal command input" type="text" value=""></div></main>"`;

